Day 11 — Jenkins + Trivy / Snyk (SCA)



Today’s focus is DevSecOps: integrating security scanning into a Jenkins CI/CD pipeline so vulnerabilities are detected before deployment.



1. What is SCA?

	SCA = Software Composition Analysis

	Modern applications use many third-party dependencies.

	For example:

	FastAPI
	   ↓
	Starlette
	   ↓
	Any vulnerable dependency?

SCA tools identify known vulnerabilities in:

	Python packages
	Node.js packages
	Java dependencies
	Docker images
	Terraform files
	Kubernetes manifests
	etc.

Examples:
    today

	Trivy
	Snyk

    projects 
	OWASP Dependency-Check  -- java 


